# Drizzle
# Replace with your DB credentials!
DATABASE_URL="postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/rqms"

# Redis
REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"

# Auth
JWT_SECRET="change-me-to-a-random-32-byte-hex-string"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production (adapter-node di balik reverse proxy)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WAJIB di-set saat app berjalan di belakang Nginx/proxy. Tanpa ini:
# - POST form action bisa ditolak 403 (cek origin SvelteKit gagal) → user tidak
#   bisa login meski kredensial benar.
# - getClientAddress() mengembalikan IP proxy, sehingga rate limit & audit log
#   memakai satu IP yang sama untuk SEMUA user.
#
# ORIGIN="https://qms.contoh.com"
# ADDRESS_HEADER="x-forwarded-for"
# XFF_DEPTH="1"
# PROTOCOL_HEADER="x-forwarded-proto"
# HOST_HEADER="x-forwarded-host"
#
# Catatan:
# - ADDRESS_HEADER hanya boleh diaktifkan jika proxy MENIMPA/menghapus
#   header X-Forwarded-For dari client (kalau tidak, IP bisa dipalsukan).
# - XFF_DEPTH = jumlah proxy tepercaya di depan app (Nginx saja = 1).
# - Nginx harus meneruskan: proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
#   proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme; proxy_set_header Host $host;
# - BODY_SIZE_LIMIT default adapter-node 512K; hooks.server.ts membatasi 1MB.
